$MDESC::Type = "Star Wars";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The Galactic Empire and the Rebel Alliance battle each other on Tatooine." @
         "\n\n<f1>Jedi Archives: " @
         "\n\n<f0>Tatooine" @
         "\n\n<f0>The Rebel Alliance have made a Jawa Sandcrawler their new mobile base on the planet Tatooine, but the Galactic Empire have now taken over Jabba's Palace!!" @
         "\n\n<f0>Part of a binary star system, the planet orbits two scorching suns and is the homeworld to the Jawa and Tusken Raider species." @
         "\n\n<f2>What a desolate place this is. Well, if there's a bright center to the universe, you're on the planet that it's farthest from.";